    "3124092b-a473-448b-b237-7c9b098cd472": {
      "type": "columns-2",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20086275309889__3124092b-a473-448b-b237-7c9b098cd472-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>In this 7-week beginners' astral projection course, Jade Shaw guides you step by step through the essentials of out-of-body astral travel, blending neuroscience, cultural traditions, and practical tools that you can train and apply.</p><p>Whether you're drawn to psychological healing, spiritual practice, or simply everyday wellbeing, this course offers a sacred and structured path. You’ll uncover the core mechanics of<strong> Astral Projection</strong>, explore the unique states of consciousness that induce it, and begin to navigate nonphysical realities with trust, presence, and inner clarity.</p><p>Through 7 immersive modules, you’ll learn in depth what <strong>Astral Projection</strong> is, how ancient cultures have approached it, and how to enter the Out-Of-Body States using Jade’s signature S.T.A.T.E. Method, a framework applied in scientific research. You’ll receive guidance on navigating expanded states, refining your awareness, and integrating what you discover along the way.</p>"
          }
        },
