    "rich_text_G76kDW": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_cJKCEg": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The truth about Astral Projection ",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_8JnWga": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>The Art of Astral Projection: The secret skill you never knew you had. </p><p><strong>What if you could access expanded states of consciousness and connect with people and places beyond space and time? Where would you go, who would you meet and what would you bring back? </strong></p><p>Did you know that Plato, the American Military and even the Dalai Lama have practised <strong>Out-Of-Body Experiences</strong>. </p><p>Why? </p><p>● Neuroscientists say it’s because your Self transcends the body, decreasing anxiety.</p><p>● Psychologists say it’s because you have epiphanies and life-changing insights. </p><p>● Buddhists say it’s because you begin to know the nature of reality and who you truly are. </p><p>● Shamans say it’s because you enter the spirit world and heal trauma. </p><p>● Spiritualists say it’s because you encounter dead loved ones and heal grief. </p><p>I say it’s because you enter incredible worlds of awe, and experience possibilities beyond your perception, finding purpose and peace. This not only elevates your life, but also helps others along the way. </p><p>In fact, I conducted a study that proved that Out-Of-Body Experiences cause 8 transformative effects on our participants' lives: It served as a motivational catalyst, reduced fear of death, enhanced inner peace, generated new life perspectives, increased self-awareness, cultivated a sense of individuality, reassessed relationships, and strengthened existing or developed new spiritual beliefs. </p><p>You are the Portal. </p><p>Travel beyond limits and return transformed. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
