        "text_GbN3KA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>The Portal is the missing methodology for those drawn to learn astral projection but seeking structure and verification. This Astral Projection Journey, led by researcher Jade Shaw, is the only self-paced course that bridges ancient wisdom, profound spiritual longing, and a scientific framework—the S.T.A.T.E. Method—to safely enter out-of-body states. Unlock the truth that liberates you from the fear of the unknown and reveals your infinite self. Your journey to two-world mastery begins now.</p>"
          }
        },
