    "f2f16573-2553-4b00-98b9-ad9c6717eedc": {
      "type": "icon-list-and-image",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20315243544897__f2f16573-2553-4b00-98b9-ad9c6717eedc-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "In this 7-week class, you’ll master:",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_J6gAE8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>The foundations of Astral Projection</strong>: What it is, why it matters, and how to safely prepare your mind, body, and energy. You’ll come away with a personalised projection plan.</li><li><strong>Jade's science-based S.T.A.T.E. induction method: </strong>A 5-step framework used in scientific research. Gain a reliable pathway into out-of-body states.</li><li><strong>Navigation skills for new realms:</strong> Get oriented in nonphysical realities. Master your emotions to move through astral landscapes with calm confidence.</li><li><strong>Discover powerful tools,</strong> such as sensory deprivation, sound technology, energy work and herbal rituals.</li><li><strong>Get a complete ‘exit’ toolkit: </strong>Try methods like Corkscrew, Levitation, and the Phantom Limb Test.</li><li><strong>The art of integration: </strong>Give your experiences meaning, and turn extraordinary insights into permanent life upgrades.</li><li><strong>Tap into embodiment practices:</strong> Learn to apply your new awareness in daily life. </li><li><strong>Bonus Egyptian wisdom:</strong> harness ancient astral tools like Blue Lotus Tea ritual, sacred mantra, body posture, and deity guidance to enrich your practice with timeless power. </li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
