    "rich_text_eM6yVa": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_RQqKbR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why The Portal Works & What You Get Inside",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_Ead3pQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Unlike other approaches, The Portal bridges rigorous scientific methodology with profound wisdom traditions. The S.T.A.T.E. Method has been used in research settings, while the preparation & integration practices are informed by Jade's personal experience and professional work in diverse settings with ordinary people. </p><p>This foundational training is about building real skill through consistent practice, understanding the psychology behind altered states, and developing the foundation for a lifelong journey of consciousness exploration. </p>"
          }
        },
