      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Module_1.png",
        "image_mask": "landscape",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Week 1: Open the Portal",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Every great journey starts with a first step, and here you’ll unlock the portal to your inner universe. This module introduces you to the essence of out-of-body exploration: what OBEs are, why they matter, and how to prepare your mind, body, and spirit for the adventure ahead. You’ll uncover the core principles that make projection possible, design your own projection plan, and practice simple yet powerful tools to calm fear, prime your consciousness, and create a safe energetic space. By the end, you’ll feel grounded, prepared, and ready to incubate your first Out-Of-Body Experience.</p><p>● Discover the core principles of Astral Projection </p><p>● Understand Out-of-Body Experiences through the lens of science, psychology & anthropology. </p><p>● Begin to incubate your first Out-of-Body Experience. </p><p>● Create Your ‘<em>Projection Plan’ (</em>where do you want to go, what would you like to do and why?) </p><p>● Learn the <em>‘Micro-Mindfulness’ </em>tool to priming consciousness for OBE states. </p><p>● Harness the <em>‘Metta Moment</em>’ to shift fear and stay calm before, during and after an OBE. </p><p>● Practise the <em>‘Energy Ball’ </em>exercise to set your energetic space, release limiting beliefs, and protect your energy during your astral adventures. </p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "center",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "center_top",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": false,
