      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Module_2.png",
        "image_mask": "landscape",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Week 2: Activate the Astral Body",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Awaken the subtle part of yourself that makes out-of-body exploration possible. In this module, you’ll discover the three foundational steps that every beginner must master  from entering the Mind-Awake-Body-Asleep state, to moving through the vibrational gateway, and finally, practicing your first exit from the body. Along the way, you’ll learn how to relax quickly, tap into the power of sleep states, and find the posture that works best for you. By the end, you’ll feel equipped and confident to connect with your astral body and cross the threshold beyond the physical world.</p><p>● Activate your Astral Body through ‘Parts Work’ from western psychology. </p><p>● Master the <em>Mind-Awake-Body-Asleep </em>(MABA) foundational state vital for OBEs. </p><p>● Learn to ride the transitional <em>Vibrational Gateway </em>and how to embrace it. </p><p>● Practice the <em>4-7-8 breathwork technique </em>for deep relaxation fast. </p><p>● Explore the best position for your body type to enter altered states. </p><p>● Harness sleep states, hack your hypnogogic highway, do your own <em>Beditation. </em></p><p>● Discover one of the easiest <em>exit techniques </em>to shift beyond the body. </p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "center",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "center_top",
        "color_scheme": "1",
