        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Week 3: Discover The S.T.A.T.E. Method",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Discover Jade’s signature S.T.A.T.E. system - a five-step framework that blends psychology, neuroscience, and anthropology into a reliable pathway for out-of-body exploration. This structured method is developed from over a decade of teaching and used in scientific studies to trigger OBEs. In this module, you’ll learn how to prime your awareness, use energy centres and deepen your ability to drop into out-of-body states for regular astral journeys. Along the way, you’ll discover how to dissolve mental blocks, increase your tolerance for the unknown, and use sound and sensory training to expand the doorways of perception. </p><p>● Master the complete S.T.A.T.E. framework for consistent results. </p><p>● Remove blocks and barriers that prevent a successful practise. </p><p>● Build courage by increasing your uncertainty tolerance and ability to enter vast astral landscapes via the <em>‘Yes Man’ </em>challenge. </p><p>● Make a sensory deprivation chamber, a timeless technique used across worldwide traditions. </p><p>● Use sound technology to help your brain get into the right frequency, experience guided binaural meditation for OBE states. </p><p>● Train the 3rd Eye Exit Technique to leave the body and achieve your projection plan. </p>",
