      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Module_4.png",
        "image_mask": "landscape",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Week 4: Navigate Other Worlds",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Enter the vast landscapes beyond your physical body and learn how to orient yourself in realms that defy time and space. This module equips you with the tools to move through unfamiliar environments with calm curiosity, transforming fear into fascination for unshakable confidence. You’ll discover different types of astral realms and anchor yourself in clarity so that every journey becomes both safe and deeply transformative. </p><p>● Adopt the <em>‘Valley View’ </em>to navigate diverse realms of reality. </p><p>● Apply the <em>R.A.I.N technique </em>for better recall and emotional regulation. </p><p>● Double your chances of Astral Projection by training the <em>wake-back-to-bed method. </em></p><p>● Implement <em>Therapeutic Tremoring </em>to release anxiety, relax the body and encourage body dissolution. </p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "center",
