    "b1e017d0-0cb2-4059-b854-c122e1dd779e": {
      "type": "text-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "9c459782-e688-4c91-b2f9-22e7ba873d45": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": false,
            "image_mask": "rounded",
            "image_width": 320,
            "title": "",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>I’m Jade Shaw, an <strong>Astral Projection </strong>researcher, teacher, and international speaker.<br/><br/>A life-changing Out-Of-Body Experience over a decade ago set me on a path of deep study and practice. Since then, I’ve been on a whirlwind journey which involves…<br/><br/>⟡ <strong>Netflix</strong>: Taught the cast and consulted for the NO1 Netflix show ‘Behind her Eyes’.<br/>⟡ <strong>Amazon Prime</strong>: Produced and hosted the film ‘Insight Out’ on Amazon Prime and Gaia TV.<br/>⟡ <strong>Masters</strong>: Undertook a Msc Transpersonal Psychology and Mindfulness Teacher Training.<br/>⟡ <strong>Forbes</strong>: Published peer-reviewed scientific paper on OBEs featured in Forbes.<br/>⟡<strong> World 1st:</strong> Leading 1st long-term scientific study on OBEs and self change, with Institute of Noetic Sciences.<br/>⟡ <strong>National Press</strong>: Mindfulness approach to OBEs for wellbeing covered for 1st time in UK press.<br/>⟡ <strong>Celebrities</strong>: Advised Fortune 500 CEOs, Hollywood Actors, TV Hosts, NY Times bestselling authors.<br/>⟡ <strong>Cultural Traditions</strong>: Lived and studied in a Tibetan Buddhist temple for 5 years, undertook pilgrimage around India and attended shamanic retreats around the world.<br/><br/><strong>Guided thousands worldwide to access out-of-body states for transformation.</strong><br/><br/>Astral projection is one of the most eye-opening, liberating experiences you can have, and I’m honored to help you begin your journey.<br/></p>",
            "align_text": "left",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
