    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "12d522a9-b741-4d4c-9b79-bb469c9fa36d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is included in this course?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>47 immersive video classes.</p><p>7 guided meditations to support each step of the journey.</p><p>A 90-minute guided audio journey with binaural beats to trigger altered states.</p><p>15+ guided experiential exercises woven throughout the modules.</p><p>6 printable worksheets to support the practice.</p><p>A Bonus module on the ancient Egyptian approach to astral projection, including a guided tea ritual.</p><p>A deep dive into Jade’s signature S.T.A.T.E. Method, the 5-step induction process previously used in a scientific study.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_V8YmcL": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is the S.T.A.T.E. Method?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>This method breaks down out-of-body states into trainable stages, rather than treating them as spontaneous or mystical accidents.</p><p>Instead of “hoping something happens,” you learn how to:</p><ul><li>Recognize the physiological markers of altered states</li><li>Enter them intentionally</li><li>Stabilize awareness once inside</li><li>Exit safely and integrate meaningfully</li></ul>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_V78rTz": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What will I be able to do by Week 7 of this course?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>By the end of The Portal, you will be able to:</p><ul><li>Enter altered states of consciousness intentionally</li><li>Recognize and stabilize the threshold between body and awareness</li><li>Induce out-of-body states using a repeatable framework</li><li>Navigate fear, excitement, or disorientation during nonphysical experiences</li><li>Extract insight and meaning from experiences rather than chasing phenomena</li><li>Apply expanded awareness to relationships, creativity, grief, and life direction</li></ul>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8b288a22-fe25-4939-a8bc-2bd82abe3281": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is the refund and cancellation policy?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>⟡ The customer is eligible for a refund by written request within 48 hours from purchasing the course, and the customer hasn’t begun the course.</p><p>⟡ Other refund requests will be reviewed on an individual basis.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
